{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09628","headline":"东归留题太常徐卿草堂 · 岑参","name":"东归留题太常徐卿草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"不谢古名将，吾知徐太常。\n年才三十余，勇冠西南方。\n顷曾策匹马，独出持两枪。\n虏骑无数来，见君不敢当。\n汉将小卫霍，蜀将凌关张。\n卿月益清澄，将星转光芒。\n复居少城北，遥对岷山阳。\n车马日盈门，宾客常满堂。\n曲池荫高树，小径穿丛篁。\n江鸟飞入帘，山云来到牀。\n题诗芭蕉滑，对酒椶花香。\n诸将射猎时，君在翰墨场。\n圣主赏勳业，边城最辉光。\n与我情绸缪，相知久芬芳。\n忽作万里别，东归三峡长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09628.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09628","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}